  "footer": {
    "title": "Logos theology",
    "content": "\"The Word\" (Greek: Logos) was known in both Jewish and Greek philosophy. John uses the term to show that Jesus is God's wisdom and self-expression—the same one who spoke at creation, who spoke through the prophets, and who has now become human."
